WEBVTT

00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:30.234
We can’t control our senior leaders,

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:32.070
we can’t control our customer demands,

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.405
and we certainly can’t control
a global pandemic.

00:00:34.489 --> 00:00:36.741
But we can actually control our time,

00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:38.534
we’ve just forgotten how to do it.

00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:41.162
I’ve come up with five, 
easy-to-implement steps

00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.457
that can take your calendar
from working against you

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:45.958
to working for you.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.126
And they really work.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:48.836
We worked with a big global company

00:00:48.836 --> 00:00:51.798
and asked some of their leaders
to put these tips into practice

00:00:51.798 --> 00:00:52.799
while others didn’t.

00:00:52.799 --> 00:00:53.800
And guess what?

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.095
The leaders who used these steps
saw significant hours open up

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:58.096
on their calendars

00:00:58.096 --> 00:01:00.348
for, you know, actual work.